  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity study- Gaza</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kapacitetsstudie - Gaza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xF6;rberedelser f&#xF6;r kapacitetsutvecklingsprogram f&#xF6;r tre kommuner och ett village council i norra Gaza. F&#xF6;rberedelserna avser en kapacitetsstudie att genomf&#xF6;ras av lokala konsulter med st&#xF6;d av en svensk r&#xE5;dgivande grupp samt omedelbara mindre kapacitetsutvecklingsinsatser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparations for a long term capacity building project in realtion to democratic management for three municipalities and a village council in northern Gaza.The preparations include a baseline study to be conducted be local consultants with support from a Swedish advisory group, and immediate smaller capacity building initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
